{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>En Mishpat, which is Kadesh.</b> Named for the future — that Moses and Aaron were destined to be judged there concerning that spring, which is the waters of Meribah. And Onkelos translated it according to its plain sense: a place where the people of the region would gather for every judgment." "<b>The field of the Amalekite.</b> Amalek had not yet been born — it was named for the future." "<b>Chavatzon Tamar.</b> It is Ein Gedi; a full verse in Chronicles (II 20), concerning Jehoshaphat."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:36.256062064Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}